### Offline support

Construction sites may have weak network connectivity.

Allow suitable operations to be saved locally as drafts or queued actions.

When connectivity returns:
- Synchronize queued actions.
- Prevent duplicate submissions.
- Display synchronization status.
- Resolve conflicting changes safely.
- Preserve original timestamps and server receipt timestamps.

Do not claim a record has been submitted successfully until the server confirms it.

### GPS and privacy

