- Capture location only for authorized operational actions or active work sessions.
- Clearly communicate when location is being captured.
- Display location accuracy and capture timestamp.
- Handle unavailable GPS.
- Handle stale location records.
- Respect Android and iOS background location restrictions.
- Do not continuously track users outside authorized working sessions.

